      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FANCY IN DESIGN (2) broke well and quickly mustered speed to win over the 342m at this track two runs back then raced on speed again when finishing second at this track last start. Has good speed and a low draw is a big help. Top prospect. DASHING DARLEY (1) was below best last time finishing fifth at Murray Bridge, but prior to that had been racing well including a Other win two back at this track. Speedy runner and should be in the action early from the inside. Key player on best and worth another try. SMOOTH PARADISE (4) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by one length at this track in a handy 19.99 beating OBSESSION. Good beginner but will need a little luck from a middle draw. Should feature again. RAFFERTY BLUES (8) is in fine form and looks a good top-three chance again.",
